<section class="container page-content">
  <header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Behind the bench</p><h1>Hi, I’m Jacob.</h1><p>I’m the person behind Odderon Lab, an independent hardware and software project based in Louisiana.</p></header>
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-copy">
      <h2>Tools I wanted at my own bench.</h2>
      <p>I work with electronics and build things. Odderon Lab grew out of that: finding an annoying problem, making something to solve it, and seeing whether it could be useful to someone else.</p>
      <p>DevGuard 24 adds inline protection to DC projects. DriverBench started with testing speakers and wanting an easier way to save measurements, compare drivers, and put the results into a useful report.</p>
      <p>You can follow the builds and experiments in <a href="/labnotes/">Lab Notes</a>, or see what’s available on the <a href="/products/">products page</a>.</p>
